<title>USA: Everest cuts Morgan Stanley Russia stake.</title>
<headline>Everest cuts Morgan Stanley Russia stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everest Capital Ltd., a Bermuda-based investment manager, said Tuesday that it cut its stake in Morgan Stanley Russia &amp; New Europe Fund Inc. to 298,955 common shares, or 5.9 percent of the total.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Everest said it sold 200,000 shares on Feb. 24 and 28 at $24.50 and $25.00 a share.</p>
</text>
